# --- local working state (NOT for a public repo) -----------------------------
# STATUS.md is an ephemeral scratchpad: current blockers, machine-specific
# notes, and observations about the live AWS account. It stays on disk and out
# of git. The durable contract is docs/PLAN.md; the decision record is
# BUILD_LOG.md.
STATUS.md
NOTES.local.md
*.local.md
scratch/

